  "sections": [
    {
      "label": "research",
      "items": [
        {
          "date": "2025 — 2026",
          "title": "AI Agent Use for Coding in 2025",
          "summary": "Preprint → ASE '26",
          "detailHtml": "<p>We study how professional software developers actually use AI agents for coding in 2025—when they delegate, when they intervene, and how they maintain control over design and correctness rather than only “vibing” with suggestions.</p><p>With Ruanqianqian (Lisa) Huang, Sorin Lerner, Haijun Xia, and Brian Hempel.</p><p><a href=\"https://ai-agents-for-coding-in-2025.vercel.app\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Project site</a></p>",
          "footnoteLink": {
            "label": "Read on arXiv",
            "url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2512.14012"
          },
          "image": {
            "src": "/assets/projects/research/agentic_coding_2025.gif",
            "alt": "AI agent use for coding research preview"
          }
        },
        {
          "date": "2024",
          "title": "Help Supporters",
          "summary": "CHI '24",
          "detailHtml": "<p>We explore the design space of assistive technologies that make face-to-face help between blind and sighted strangers easier—supporting coordination, trust, and lightweight interaction in public settings.</p><p>With Yuanyang Teng, Connor Courtien, David Rios, Yves Tseng, Jacqueline Gibson, Maryam Aziz, Rajan Vaish, and Brian Smith.</p><p><a href=\"https://help-supporters.vercel.app\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Project site</a></p>",
          "footnoteLink": {
            "label": "ACM Digital Library",
            "url": "https://dl.acm.org/doi/10.1145/3613904.3642816"
          },
          "image": {
            "src": "/assets/projects/research/help_supporters.gif",
            "alt": "Help Supporters research preview"
          }
        },
        {
          "date": "2023",
          "title": "Spatial Interactions",
          "summary": "ASSETS '23",
          "detailHtml": "<p>We report blind and low vision users’ attitudes toward spatial interactions in desktop screen readers—what feels useful, what feels fragile, and how spatial metaphors fit (or clash) with existing navigation strategies.</p><p>With Arnavi Chheda-Kothary, David Rios, Kynnedy Simone Smith, Cecilia Zhang, and Brian Smith.</p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/ceal-lab/spatial-interactions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Repository</a></p>",
          "footnoteLink": {
            "label": "ACM Digital Library",
            "url": "https://dl.acm.org/doi/10.1145/3597638.3608412"
          },
          "image": {
            "src": "/assets/projects/research/spatial_screen_readers.gif",
            "alt": "Spatial interactions in screen readers research preview"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "industry",
      "items": [
        {
          "date": "2025",
          "title": "Metrics Playground",
          "summary": "Taught Cyber D&M engineers about agentic software development",
          "detailHtml": "<p>A hands-on playground for metrics and evaluation workflows aimed at Cyber D&amp;M engineers, focused on how agentic software development changes instrumentation, feedback loops, and what we choose to measure.</p>",
          "image": {
            "src": "/assets/projects/industry/metrics_playground.gif",
            "alt": "Metrics Playground preview"
          }
        },
        {
          "date": "2025",
          "title": "Admin Metrics Dashboard",
          "summary": "In-house monitoring dashboard to replace Grafana cyber logs",
          "detailHtml": "<p>An in-house admin dashboard for cyber log monitoring, designed to replace a Grafana-heavy setup with views tuned to our operators’ workflows, alert semantics, and day-to-day triage habits.</p>",
          "image": {
            "src": "/assets/projects/industry/admin_metrics_dashboard.png",
            "alt": "Admin metrics dashboard preview"
          }
        },
        {
          "date": "2024",
          "title": "ILM Portal",
          "summary": "Identity lifecycle portal for custom authorization plugins",
          "detailHtml": "<p>A portal for identity lifecycle management that supports custom authorization plugins—onboarding, changes, and deprovisioning—so policy and access stay aligned as systems evolve.</p>",
          "image": {
            "src": "/assets/projects/industry/ilm_portal.png",
            "alt": "ILM portal preview"
          }
        },
        {
          "date": "2024",
          "title": "File Upload Tool",
          "summary": "Validating native content for IAM analytics",
          "detailHtml": "<p>A file upload and validation path for native content feeding IAM analytics—checking format, completeness, and consistency before data lands in downstream reporting and access models.</p>",
          "image": {
            "src": "/assets/projects/industry/file_upload_tool.gif",
            "alt": "File upload tool preview"
          }
        },
        {
          "date": "2024",
          "title": "Penetration Test Checklists",
          "summary": "Rendering editable spreadsheets of simulated cyberattacks",
          "detailHtml": "<p>Editable spreadsheet-style checklists for penetration testing—structuring simulated attack scenarios, findings, and follow-ups so teams can collaborate without losing the rigor of a formal test record.</p>",
          "image": {
            "src": "/assets/projects/industry/penetration_tests.gif",
            "alt": "Penetration test checklists preview"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
